    "fullContent": "*A Random Day*\n\nIt all ends on a random day.\nBe the soul yearning or lost or found its way.\n\nA random moment my eyes would go dark,\nand that would be the end of my arc.\n\nThat is why I live how I live,\nMaybe even that is why I feel so deep,\n\nI enjoy moments while they last,\nWhat good would regrets do me in the dark?\n\nThat is why i stop to watch every sunset,\nTo live in the moment, without regret.\n\nMaybe one day, my days will be past,\nAt least I lived each moment to the last."
