    "fullContent": "A dream woven of many emotions,\nHappiness casting shadows on sadness,\nA new path of hope unfurls its wings,\nFor a beautiful world yet to be.\n\nAll the pains of the past,\nEased from the grip of shadows,\nHoping for a new beginning,\nTo be, and to live, together.\n\nLike a broken mirror,\nIt can be patched—not like before,\nBut happiness overrules,\nThe dark memories of the past.\n\nBut selfish time washed away\nThe tears of happiness,\nLetting her leave forever,\nReshaping emotions into frozen tears."
