    "fullContent": "Main bethe bethe sochne laga tha,\nDekhne laga tha sitaro se aage,\nFir wakt aaya mujhe meri aukaat batane.\n\nJo usne dikhaya, bataya mai seh na paya,\nMain ishq me haara hua ladka, dekho, mar bhi nahi paya.\n\nMarta bhi toh kaise marta, Jaan,\nMain apne ghar ka bada beta tha.\n\nMere uppar ghar bhi zimedariyaan thi,\nMujhe mere pita ka sahara banna tha,\nMujhe apni maa ke liye bhaut kuch karna tha.\n\nAur ishq-mohobbat se ghar nahi chalta,\nShayariyoon se pet nahi bharta,\nYeh baat mujhe mere pita ne kai bar samjhayi thi.\n\nMagar main nadan unki baat ko samajh na paya,\nMaine vahi kara jo mere mann ko bhaya.\nMain ishq me hara hua lakda dekho, mar bhi nahi paya."
