    "category": "Poetry / Verse",
    "theme": "Official Nominee",
    "excerpt": "Wo dost mera chhota-mota shayar tha Jiski aaj ho chuki hai maut Suna khud hi khudki jaan le li Mila ek khudkushi ka khat Maine kaha tha, Lagaav tujhe maar dengi Wo janaab kehkar jaan legi Log bolenge...",
    "fullContent": "Wo dost mera chhota-mota shayar tha\nJiski aaj ho chuki hai maut\nSuna khud hi khudki jaan le li\nMila ek khudkushi ka khat\n\nMaine kaha tha, Lagaav tujhe maar dengi \nWo janaab kehkar jaan legi\nLog bolenge sala pagal mar gaya\nAur teri aag par wo sans legi\n\nMaine puchha ek baar kaun thi ? woh bola,\nnili ankhen, gora badan, kala til ek gardan par\nzubaan uski itni meethi woh bol de\nmain har gunaah le loon apne sar\n\nKhat mein likha jaan nhi li zeher ne\nYe zeher toh bas ek zariya hai\nJisme doobna tha tum tair rahe\nYe zindagi wahi dariya hai\n\nTum kehti thi , tum maar doge\nna ahsaas hoga kya insaaf hua\nIshq bhool hui jawani main\nAaj meri jaan ne hai jaan liya\n\nTere khayalon mein bechaini hai \nTeri tasveerein sukoon deti\nHar chot khud par aazmaun \nkis zakhm par tu khoon deti\n\nDost bole ki tu move on karle\nUska kisi aur se hai byah hua\nDil laga toh phir Umrqaid\nMaut se pehle kaun riha hua\n\nAb kahan par tum kandha dogi\nMere rone par ya maut par\nBolo kab mujhe apnaogi\nKafan par ya wakt par\n\nHo gaya hai tamasha \nKuch aaye-gaye log\nDo din baad kuch yaad nahi\nSab kuch bhula deta wakt\n\nPar ishq nhi , likha tha wo shayar ne\nJisko kabhi bhula sake wakt\nMaine chhe karke dekh liya \nAb bas baki ye saatvaan hai maut\n\nMaine dekha hai ye maajra\nPadha wo khudkhushi ka khat\nWo shayar mera padosi tha\nUska likha padha maine bohot\n\nPar khair woh toh gujar gaya saadgi mein\nMain gaya sach sunne suwai mein\nLog achanak se shant hue jab\nek sundar munsif aayi hadbadi mein\n\nWo boli jaldi bolo kya mamla hai\nFir kaun mara , kya jhamela hai\nEk wasiyat mere naam par thi\nYe khatam karke wahin zameen lene Jaana hai\n\nshuru hui sunwai lag gaye sab jaanch par\nLag gaye sab raaz kholne roshni daal ke kaanch par\n\n\n\nMain gaya, khada hua katghare mein\nWahan jake kalam chhukar sach kaha\njanaab, ye waqt wahin par mazood tha\nwaqt bola, main toh waqt se pehle guzar gaya\n\naur do aankhen gawah thin us Adalat mein\nWakil se baat karta ki wahan kya hua\nMaine bola chilla kar, ishq hin woh katil hai\nWakil chup, saala gawah muh par mukhar gaya\n\nKotwal bole janaab lash le aaye hain \n badan par koi nishaan nhi hai chot ka\nPar likhta kis zakhm par tu khoon deti\nShayad ye shayar hi tha jhooth ka\n\nJaan gaya aashiq ka, toh Ishq hua gunaahgaar\nMunsif boli, ye kya behuda kahani hai?\nAgar kisi ne jaan le li khanjar se\nToh kya khanjar bhi ek khooni hai\n\nUski boli meethi, kaha usne, koi nhi hai zimmedaar \nlagaav rakhe itna jyada, toh woh maut ki hai haqdaar\nSuna uska faisla aur gaur kiya aankhon par\nNili aankhen, Gora badan, kala til ek gardan par\n\nPata chala us din, jab aanch aati khud par,\nToh kaun hai apna, kaun gair\nJo shakhs na pyaar bhi de bheekh mein\nWo faisla kaise deta khudke gair?\n\nAb kya karun, koi nahi hai kandha dene \nJisko chhoda apno ne us laash ko kaun apnayenge\nIski jameen bhi toh le li hai kisi aur ne,\nAb bolo, kahan isko dafnayenge ?"
