    "fullContent": "Hume uska haath thaamna pasand tha use gairon ki baahon mein sona pasand tha\nHume uska haath thaamna pasand tha use gairon ki baahon mein sona pasand tha\n\nHume unka gairon ki baahon mein sona bhi manzoor tha\nKyunki uski khushi mein meri khushi sama rahi thi..................\n\nGhanton baitha main uski yaad mein wo kuch bikhre baal le aayi....\nGhanton baitha main uski yaad mein wo kuch bikhre baal le aayi\n\nJab poocha humne ek jhumka kahan hai tumhara\nTo kisi aur ka pata de gayi...\n\nUske jism par jo nishaan the wo mere nahi the\nPar maine use apnaana seekh liya tha\nUske jism par jo nishaan the wo mere nahi the\nPar maine use apnaana seekh liya tha\n\n\nWo har raat kisi aur ki saanson mein ghulti rahi\nAur main apne seene mein uski khushboo bachaane ki koshish karta raha\n\nJis ishq ko main ibaadat samajhta raha\nWo useke liye ek raat ki kahaani bani gai\nJis ishq ko main ibaadat samajhta raha\nWo usekr liye ek raat ki kahaani bani gai\n\nMain uske liye quaatl hota raha\nAur wo mujhe hi qaatil thehraati rahi\nMain uske liye quaatl hota raha\nAur wo mujhe hi qaatil thehraati rahi\n\nUska jism meri baahon mein tha\nPar wo naadaan poori raat kisi aur ka naam badbadaati rahi........\n\nUs raat jab wo lautkar aayi.......\nUs raat jab wo lautkar aayi\nTo uski saanson mein kisi aur ki mehek thi\nAur jab maine kuch bolne ke liye honth khole\nTo usne mere bhiiiiiiii choom liye"
