    "fullContent": "Agar ajanabi rehte, toh shayad sab asaan hota,\nna itni yaadein hoti, na itna lagav hota.\nAjanabiyon ki tarah milte,\naur ajanabiyon ki tarah bichhad bhi jaate.\nPar zindagi ko yeh kahan manzoor tha…\nsaalon tak ajanabi rahe,\nphir kismat ne milaya, pehchaan banayi,\naur hum ajanabi na rahe.\nKhushi hai ke ab hum ajanabi nahi,\npar gham yeh hai…\nke ab hum ajanabiyon ki tarah bichhad bhi nahi paate.\n- the.dax.verse"
